<section image-layout="blank" id="4DlaV60QDQ"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="b9YnFMnYVH" background-color="accent" padding="28pt 12pt 24pt" colspan="7"><p role="eyebrow">Field guide</p><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><p role="caption">CONTEXT</p><p role="caption">02 / 10</p></grid-item><grid-item id="8ugIvBovoR" padding="0" colspan="53"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="IasL06brbM" padding="0" colspan="15"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/Ysv1R3GMHPHZrsNWPSuvk.png" saved-media-id="8rd0j22g9cnjnx0" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="operational-still-life" alt="Editorial studio photograph of three distinct paper input channels converging into one operational-blue intake tray, duplicate graphite slips set aside, a small signal-amber priority tab and field-sage acknowledgement card, soft directional daylight on warm white, precise modular arrangement, no text, lettering, people, logos, or screens" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item><grid-item id="yHiYpSGH5a" padding="22pt 28pt 18pt" colspan="45"><labels><label variant="outline">Illustrative replacement · validate before use</label></labels><h2 font-size="28pt">Why it exists—and what success means</h2><p font-size="16pt">Email, chat, and inconsistent web forms create duplicate records, weak priority signals, and poor queue visibility. The project introduces one traceable intake and routing service without replacing the case-management platform.</p><table borders="rows" striped="false" header-row="false" header-col="true" col-widths="[28,22,50]" style="--table-cell-padding:6pt 8pt;"><tr><th valign="middle">User outcome</th><td valign="middle"><b>≤15 minutes</b></td><td valign="middle">Acknowledgement with a valid case reference.</td></tr><tr><th valign="middle">Operational outcome</th><td valign="middle"><b>≥90%</b></td><td valign="middle">Correct queue without manual rerouting.</td></tr><tr><th valign="middle">Reporting outcome</th><td valign="middle"><b>95%</b></td><td valign="middle">Dashboard updates complete within two hours.</td></tr><tr><th valign="middle">Control outcome</th><td valign="middle"><b>Attributable</b></td><td valign="middle">Every priority override links to an authorized role.</td></tr></table><p font-size="16pt"><b>Illustrative acceptance thresholds—not measured results.</b> Not in scope: CRM replacement, staffing redesign, an automated support bot, or customer-service policy changes.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>